// Windows resource script — embeds the application icon into the .exe so
// Explorer/Taskbar show the right icon. Regenerate icon.ico with
// `just icons` (or scripts/gen-icons.sh) when the source SVG changes.
//
// The first ICON entry by name (alphabetically) is what Windows treats as
// the application icon. We pick a leading-zero name to be safe.
1 ICON "../../assets/generated/icon.ico"
